OL,3,GNEWSAPlans for tighter control over
OL,4,AHMOs move closer
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for tighter controls on new
OL,7,Fhouses of multiple occupation in a town
OL,8,Fhave moved a step closer.
OL,10,FHartlepool Borough Council's
OL,11,Fneighbourhood and regulatory services
OL,12,Fcommittee has recommended the council
OL,13,Fadopts an Article 4 Direction across
OL,14,Fthe borough.
OL,16,FIt would means anyone intending to turn
OL,17,Fa family home into a house of multiple
OL,18,Foccupation (HMO) needs planning
OL,19,Fpermission regardless of size.
OL,23,APub: 08-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
